## 1. Average goals range per game, 1900–2000

```sql
-- 1. Average number of goals per game between 1900 and 2000
--    Interpretation: matches from 1900-01-01 to 2000-12-31 inclusive.

SELECT
    COUNT(*) AS games,
    SUM(CAST(home_score AS INTEGER) + CAST(away_score AS INTEGER)) AS total_goals,
    ROUND(AVG(CAST(home_score AS INTEGER) + CAST(away_score AS INTEGER)), 2)
                                                                  AS avg_goals_per_game
FROM results
WHERE date BETWEEN '1900-01-01' AND '2000-12-31';
```

**Result:** 23,712 games · 72,806 goals · **3.07 goals per game**

*Assumption:* 1900-01-01 to 2000-12-31 inclusive. Changing the end date to `< '2000-01-01'` excludes the year 2000.

